                            unitindex + "].ProductName' type='text' readonly value='" + item.ItemDesc + "' /></td>";

                        var unitQtyCell = "<td><input id='TOGDetail" + unitindex + "_OrderQty'  class='form-control'  name='TOGDetail[" +
                            unitindex + "].OrderQty'  readonly value='" + item.Qty + "' /></td>";

                        var unitSellingPriceCell = "<td style='display: none;'><input id='TOGDetail" + unitindex + "_SellingPrice'  class='form-control'  name='TOGDetail[" +
                            unitindex + "].SellingPrice' type='text' readonly value='" + parseFloat(Number(item.SellingPrice)).toFixed(2) + "' /></td>";

                        if (DisablePriceRequest_Note1) {
                            var unitCostPriceCell = "<td style='display: none;'><input id='TOGDetail" + unitindex + "_CostValue'  class='form-control'  name='TOGDetail[" +
                                unitindex + "].CostValue' type='text' readonly value='" + parseFloat(Number(item.CostValue)).toFixed(2) + "' /></td>";
                        }
                        else {

                            var unitCostPriceCell = "<td><input id='TOGDetail" + unitindex + "_CostValue'  class='form-control'  name='TOGDetail[" +
                                unitindex + "].CostValue' type='text' readonly value='" + parseFloat(Number(item.CostValue)).toFixed(2) + "' /></td>";
                        }

                        var unitRemoveCell = "<td><input id='btnAddGRNItem' type='button' value='-' class='btn btn-round btn-info'  onclick='removeUnitRow(" +
                            unitindex + ");' /></td>";

                        var newUnitRow = "<tr id='trTOGItem" + unitindex + "'>" +
                            unitindexCell +
                            unitIdCell +
                            unitDescCell +
                            unitQtyCell +
                            unitCostPriceCell +
                            unitSellingPriceCell +
                            unitRemoveCell + "</tr>";
                        //bgcolor='#ffff99'
                        var newUnitRow2 = "<tr bgcolor='#ffff99' id='trTOGItem" + unitindex + "'>" +
                           unitindexCell +
                           unitIdCell +
                           unitDescCell +
                           unitQtyCell +
                           unitCostPriceCell +
                           unitSellingPriceCell +
                           unitRemoveCell + "</tr>";



                        if (item.HasItem == 1)
                        {
                            // document.getElementById('lblerror').innerHTML = 'Highlighted item(s) are not exists in location : ' + $("#ToLocationId option:selected").text();
                            $("#togitems").append(newUnitRow);

                        } else
                        {
                            $("#togitems").append(newUnitRow2);
                        }


                    });
                    document.getElementById("RecQty").value = "";
                    var table = document.getElementById("togitems");

                    var totsp = 0.0;
                    var totcp = 0.0;
                    var totqty = 0;

                    var regex = /value="(\d+(\.\d)*)/i;
                    var rowproductid=0;

                    for (var r = 0, n = table.rows.length; r < n; r++)
                    {

                        rowproductid =  table.rows[r].cells[1].innerHTML.match(regex)[1];
                        var spvalue= document.getElementById('TOGDetail[' + rowproductid + ']_SellingPrice').value
                        totsp += Number(spvalue);

                        var cpvalue = document.getElementById('TOGDetail[' + rowproductid + ']_CostValue').value
                        totcp += Number(cpvalue);

                    }
                    document.getElementById("TotSellingPrice").value = parseFloat(totsp).toFixed(2);
                    document.getElementById("TotCostPrice").value = parseFloat(totcp).toFixed(2);
                    // document.getElementById("TotQty").value = parseFloat(totqty).toFixed(2);

                    document.getElementById("GrossAmount").value = parseFloat(
                        Number(document.getElementById("TotSellingPrice").value)
                    ).toFixed(2);

                    document.getElementById("NetAmount").value = parseFloat((
                            Number(document.getElementById("TotCostPrice").value))
                    ).toFixed(2);
                },
                error: function (error) {
                    alert("Item data mapping error");
                }
            });

        });




</script>

